sequenceDiagram
    title Fluxo dinamico - Fatia vertical da Sprint 1 e extensao futura

    actor Operadora as Dona/operadora da loja
    participant CLI as CLI/Test Harness
    participant UI as Frontend React
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant ImportUC as ImportPurchaseProposalUseCase
    participant ReviewUC as ReviewImportProposalUseCase
    participant ApproveUC as ApprovePurchaseUseCase
    participant Reader as DocumentReaderPort
    participant Normalizer as PurchaseNormalizer
    participant Validator as PurchaseValidator
    participant Repo as PurchaseRepositoryPort
    participant ExportUC as ExportApprovedPurchaseUseCase
    participant Exporter as ManagementSystemExporterPort
    participant NEX as NEX

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over CLI,Exporter: Sprint 1 - fatia vertical demonstravel
        CLI->>ImportUC: importar JSON controlado baseado na foto/pedido
        ImportUC->>Reader: ler documento de entrada controlado
        Reader-->>ImportUC: RawDocumentExtraction
        ImportUC->>Normalizer: normalizar dados extraidos
        Normalizer-->>ImportUC: Purchase draft / ImportProposal
        ImportUC->>Validator: validar fornecedor, paginas, itens e totais
        Validator-->>ImportUC: ValidationResult[]
        ImportUC->>Repo: salvar proposta e validacoes
        ImportUC-->>CLI: proposta com status NEEDS_REVIEW ou PROPOSED
        CLI->>ExportUC: gerar saida demonstrativa
        ExportUC->>Repo: buscar proposta aprovada/simulada
        ExportUC->>Exporter: exportar JSON/CSV
        Exporter-->>ExportUC: ExportResult
        ExportUC-->>CLI: caminho do arquivo gerado
    end

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over Operadora,NEX: Sprints 2/3 - fluxo alvo com interface e integracao real
        Operadora->>UI: envia foto, pedido, PDF ou planilha
        UI->>API: POST /purchase-imports
        API->>ImportUC: importar documento
        ImportUC->>Reader: ler via OCR/PDF/XLSX/XML real se existir
        Reader-->>ImportUC: RawDocumentExtraction
        ImportUC-->>API: ImportProposal
        API-->>UI: exibir proposta para revisao humana
        Operadora->>UI: corrige e aprova campos
        UI->>API: enviar decisoes de revisao
        API->>ReviewUC: aplicar decisoes humanas
        ReviewUC-->>API: proposta revisada
        API->>ApproveUC: aprovar compra revisada
        ApproveUC-->>API: ApprovedPurchase
        API->>ExportUC: exportar compra aprovada
        alt API ou planilha oficial confirmada
            ExportUC->>Exporter: enviar para adaptador NEX
            Exporter->>NEX: API/planilha conforme viabilidade
        else sem integracao confirmada
            ExportUC->>Exporter: gerar CSV/JSON intermediario
        end
    end
